cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Quadratic-program bounds for partial traces"
version: 1.0.0
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Costa Rico"
    given-names: "Pablo"
  - family-names: "Shteyner"
    given-names: "Pavel"
date-released: 2026-08-23
abstract: >-
  Python implementation of the quadratic programs accompanying the paper
  "Sharp Inequalities for Schur-Convex Functionals of Partial Traces over
  Unitary Orbits". The code reproduces the numerical computations in the
  paper and computes bounds for arbitrary spectra of equal bipartite systems.
repository-code: "https://github.com/pashteiner/partial-trace-inequalities"
keywords:
  - "partial trace"
  - "majorization"
  - "Schur-convex functions"
  - "quadratic programming"
  - "quantum information"
